## 1) Introduction

**ML2++** extends ThingML to integrate time-series forecasting and ML into IoT system design. We’ll use a simple **PingPong** use case—client ↔ server ↔ data-analytics—to illustrate messages, ports, statecharts, and the ML pipeline. :contentReference[oaicite:1]{index=1}

