## 2) ML2++ Web Editor (buttons & flow)

Use the hosted web editor to try models:
- **Save Model** – save your current model
- **Show Preprocessing Plot** – visualize preprocessing
- **Generate Code** – create Python/Java backend
- **Download Code**
- **Run Code** – execute generated pipeline
- **Show Forecasting Plots** – view outputs  
These provide an end-to-end loop from model → code → results. :contentReference[oaicite:2]{index=2}

